# DS5005: an unknown `kind` value.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| summarize revenue = sum(revenue) by customerId
| render columnchart with (kind = stacked10)
---- expected
error[DS5005]: unknown `kind` value `stacked10`
  --> query:3:35
  |
3 | | render columnchart with (kind = stacked10)
  |                                   ^^^^^^^^^ expected `default`, `unstacked`, `stacked` or `stacked100`
  |
  = help: a value with a similar name exists: `stacked100`
